# Popover caret (center on trigger)

PrimeNG `p-popover` aims the caret at the **left edge** of the toggle. Product standard: caret points at the **horizontal center** of the trigger.

## Required pattern

- Import **`AppPopoverModule`** (not bare `PopoverModule`).
- `appendTo="body"` on the popover.
- Add **`appCenterPopoverCaret`** on every `p-popover`.

```html
<p-popover #menu appendTo="body" appCenterPopoverCaret styleClass="tm-popover">
```

- Toggle with an explicit target when the click can land on a child (e.g. icon):

```typescript
popover.toggle(event, event.currentTarget as HTMLElement);
```

Implementation: `admin/src/app/core/popover-center.util.ts` + `CenterPopoverCaretDirective`.

## Do not

- One-off `onShow` nudges or CSS `transform` on `::before`/`::after` (detaches the caret).
- Import `PopoverModule` alone for body-appended menus.
